","conclusionRefs":[[0,25,"MeasureTheory.Measure.map"],[27,34,"Learning.history"],[44,45,"HAdd.hAdd"],[52,53,"Eq"],[56,81,"MeasureTheory.Measure.map"],[85,112,"MeasurableEquiv.finSuccProd"],[114,119,"Learning.Round"],[130,134,"MeasurableEquiv.symm"],[142,167,"MeasureTheory.Measure.map"],[169,176,"Learning.history"],[189,197,"MeasureTheory.Measure.compProd"],[199,209,"Learning.stepKernel"]],"decl":"Learning.map_history_succ_of_hasCondDistrib"},"code":"/-- If the step at round `n` has conditional law `stepKernel alg env n` given the first `n`\nrounds under a measure `Q`, then the law of the first `n + 1` rounds under `Q` is the\ncomposition-product of the law of the first `n` rounds with the step kernel. -/\nlemma map_history_succ_of_hasCondDistrib {Q : Measure Ω} {n : ℕ}\n    (hO : ∀ n, Measurable (O n)) (hX : ∀ n, Measurable (X n)) (hY : ∀ n, Measurable (Y n))\n    (h : HasCondDistrib (step O X Y n) (history O X Y n) (stepKernel alg env n) Q) :\n    Q.map (history O X Y (n + 1)) =\n      (Q.map (history O X Y n) ⊗ₘ stepKernel alg env n).map\n        (MeasurableEquiv.finSuccProd (Round 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨) n).symm","proof":":= by\n  rw [history_succ, ← h.map_eq,\n    Measure.map_map (MeasurableEquiv.finSuccProd (Round 𝓞 𝓐 𝓨) n).symm.measurable\n      (by fun_prop)]","source":{"path":"Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/HistoryLaw.lean","start":33,"end":44,"url":"https://github.com/RemyDegenne/colt-2026-83/blob/3f6c0f296a3b7e4aa8fe333225505f5b2f61f9e0/Maiti2026Power/LeanMachineLearning/HistoryLaw.lean#L33-L44"},"deps":[],"outside":[],"external":[["DFunLike.coe","mathlib","definition"],["Eq","lean4","inductive"],["EquivLike.toFunLike","mathlib","instance"],["Fin","lean4","structure"],["HAdd.hAdd","lean4","definition"],["Learning.Algorithm","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Environment","LeanMachineLearning","structure"],["Learning.Hist","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.Round","LeanMachineLearning","definition"],["Learning.history","LeanMachineLearning","defi